[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4322.63, "timestamp": "01:12:02", "text": "何てことだ。何てことだ。何てことだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4325.27, "timestamp": "01:12:05", "text": "私たちには、自らを高める方法がある。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4327.83, "timestamp": "01:12:07", "text": "もうセックスなんて必要ない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4331.99, "timestamp": "01:12:11", "text": "これは色っぽい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4334.07, "timestamp": "01:12:14", "text": "はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4336.87, "timestamp": "01:12:16", "text": "ファッキンみたいな絵を描いてもいいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4340.07, "timestamp": "01:12:20", "text": "ここに浮遊ディスクがあるので"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4346.07, "timestamp": "01:12:26", "text": "面白いことにね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4348.709, "timestamp": "01:12:28", "text": "面白い。さあ行こう。ああ、大好き"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4351.51, "timestamp": "01:12:31", "text": "それはとても多くの意味を持つ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4353.59, "timestamp": "01:12:33", "text": "わかった、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4355.75, "timestamp": "01:12:35", "text": "あなたは円盤を召喚する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4357.75, "timestamp": "01:12:37", "text": "私は円盤を召喚する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4358.55, "timestamp": "01:12:38", "text": "もちろんさ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4360.31, "timestamp": "01:12:40", "text": "ディスクに飛び乗るよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4361.189, "timestamp": "01:12:41", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4363.27, "timestamp": "01:12:43", "text": "だから、それを踏んで、それから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4367.51, "timestamp": "01:12:47", "text": "クソみたいな胸を叩いて、ここを出て行け。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4369.27, "timestamp": "01:12:49", "text": "わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4371.91, "timestamp": "01:12:51", "text": "よし。ああ、そうだね。この"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4373.99, "timestamp": "01:12:53", "text": "でも、私はあなたに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4376.39, "timestamp": "01:12:56", "text": "小さな曲芸。それはとても"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4378.229, "timestamp": "01:12:58", "text": "直流電圧はかなり低いですが、ごくわずかです。私"}]